    "textTranslated": "This was our first choice for our first day in Berlin, and we're so glad we came! Everything was wonderful; the staff, the atmosphere, the environment, and especially the döner kebab were delicious. We left very satisfied. The waiter who served us was very attentive and friendly; we thank him as well. 🙏🏻"
